---json
{
  "layout": "layouts/base.njk",
  "title": "Contact Us | Get Lagos Now — Start a Conversation",
  "description": "Tell Get Lagos Now what you're working on. Start a conversation about website design and development, accessibility, SEO and AI visibility, branding, or digital marketing.",
  "dataPage": "contact",
  "css": [
    "style.css",
    "responsive.css",
    "contact.css"
  ],
  "js": [
    "main.js"
  ],
  "robots": null,
  "themeColor": true,
  "preconnectFonts": true,
  "preconnectSource": true,
  "navComment": "<!-- ============ 01 NAVIGATION ============ -->",
  "footerComment": "<!-- ============ 07 FOOTER (shared component) ============ -->",
  "footerCredit": "Editorial photography via Pexels. Project imagery © respective clients.",
  "nav": {
    "headerCtaActive": true,
    "footerCurrent": {
      "explore": "contact.html"
    }
  },
  "cta": {
    "sectionClass": "ct-cta",
    "titleId": "cta-title",
    "title": "Let's Talk.",
    "wrapper": "plain",
    "lineClass": "ct-cta__line",
    "line": "Ready to bring your ideas to life? We'd love to hear from you.",
    "href": "#contact-form",
    "strong": "Start a project",
    "sub": "Tell us about your idea."
  }
}
---


    <!-- ============ 01 HERO (shared inner-page hero) ============ -->
    <section class="inner-page-hero" aria-labelledby="contact-hero-title">
      <div class="container inner-page-hero__grid">
        <div class="inner-page-hero__content reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
          <h1 id="contact-hero-title" class="inner-page-hero__title">Great Things Start<br>With A Conversation.</h1>
          <p class="inner-page-hero__text">Have a project in mind, a challenge to solve, or an idea worth exploring? We'd love to hear about it. Tell us what you're working on, and let's explore what's possible.</p>
          <div class="inner-page-hero__cta">
            <a href="#contact-form" class="btn btn--dark">
              <span>Start Your Project</span>
              <span class="btn__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 3v10M4 9l4 4 4-4"/></svg></span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="inner-page-hero__visual reveal">
          <figure class="inner-page-hero__primary">
            <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/7674645/pexels-photo-7674645.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1400"
                 alt="Creative team discussing a project around a table in a naturally lit studio"
                 width="1400" height="933" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
          </figure>
          <figure class="inner-page-hero__detail">
            <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/7257232/pexels-photo-7257232.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700"
                 alt="Close-up of design notes and sketches on a studio desk"
                 width="700" height="467" decoding="async">
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 02 MAIN PROJECT INQUIRY ============ -->
    <section class="ct-inquiry section" id="contact-form" aria-labelledby="inquiry-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="panel panel--dark ct-inquiry__panel">
          <div class="ct-inquiry__intro reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Let's get started</p>
            <h2 id="inquiry-title" class="h2 h2--light">Tell us what<br>you're working on.</h2>
            <p class="ct-inquiry__text">Every great project begins with understanding your ideas, goals, and challenges. Share a little about what you need, and let's start the conversation.</p>

            <dl class="ct-inquiry__meta">
              <div>
                <dt>Direct phone</dt>
                <dd><a href="tel:+18557398361">855.739.8361</a></dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt>Location</dt>
                <dd>Portland, Oregon</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt>Response time</dt>
                <dd>Within 24 hours during normal operating hours</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>

            <a href="#contact-faq" class="link-arrow link-arrow--light ct-inquiry__faq-link">
              <span>Questions before starting? Read the FAQ</span>
              <span class="link-arrow__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 3v10M4 9l4 4 4-4"/></svg></span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <form class="form ct-form reveal" id="projectInquiryForm" novalidate>
            <div class="ct-hp" aria-hidden="true">
              <label for="ctRole">Leave this field empty</label>
              <input type="text" id="ctRole" name="organization_role" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
            </div>

            <div class="form__row">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="ctName">01 — Full Name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <input type="text" id="ctName" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your full name" required aria-describedby="ctName-err">
                <p class="field__error" id="ctName-err" aria-live="polite"></p>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="ctEmail">02 — Work Email <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
                <input type="email" id="ctEmail" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@organization.org" required aria-describedby="ctEmail-err">
                <p class="field__error" id="ctEmail-err" aria-live="polite"></p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form__row">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="ctPhone">03 — Phone Number</label>
                <input type="tel" id="ctPhone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="Optional">
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="ctWebsite">04 — Current Website</label>
                <input type="text" id="ctWebsite" name="website" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" placeholder="example.org (optional)" aria-describedby="ctWebsite-err">
                <p class="field__error" id="ctWebsite-err" aria-live="polite"></p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="field ct-services" id="ctServicesGroup" aria-describedby="ctServices-err">
              <legend>05 — What Do You Need Help With? <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></legend>
              <div class="ct-services__grid">
                <label class="ct-check">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="services" value="Website Design & Development">
                  <span>Website Design &amp; Development</span>
                </label>
                <label class="ct-check">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="services" value="Website Redesign">
                  <span>Website Redesign</span>
                </label>
                <label class="ct-check">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="services" value="Accessibility & SEO">
                  <span>Accessibility &amp; SEO</span>
                </label>
                <label class="ct-check">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="services" value="Branding & Creative">
                  <span>Branding &amp; Creative</span>
                </label>
                <label class="ct-check">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="services" value="Digital Marketing">
                  <span>Digital Marketing</span>
                </label>
                <label class="ct-check">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="services" value="Strategy & Consulting">
                  <span>Strategy &amp; Consulting</span>
                </label>
                <label class="ct-check">
                  <input type="checkbox" name="services" value="Other">
                  <span>Other</span>
                </label>
              </div>
              <p class="field__error" id="ctServices-err" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </fieldset>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="ctMessage">06 — Tell Us About Your Project <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <textarea id="ctMessage" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us about your goals, challenges, timeline, or the ideas you want to bring to life." required aria-describedby="ctMessage-err"></textarea>
              <p class="field__error" id="ctMessage-err" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </div>

            <p class="ct-consent" id="ctConsent">
              07 — We'll use the details you share only to respond to your inquiry, in accordance with our <a href="https://getlagosnow.com/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a>. Submitting this form does not subscribe you to a newsletter.
            </p>

            <div class="form__foot ct-form__foot">
              <p class="form__note">Static frontend prototype — form delivery is not yet connected to a backend service.</p>
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn--dark" id="ctSubmit" aria-describedby="ctConsent">
                <span id="ctSubmitLabel">Send Inquiry</span>
                <span class="btn__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></span>
              </button>
            </div>

            <p class="form__status ct-form__status" id="ctFormStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 03 OTHER WAYS TO CONNECT ============ -->
    <section class="ct-direct section" aria-labelledby="direct-title">
      <div class="container ct-direct__grid">
        <div class="ct-direct__intro reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Reach out directly</p>
          <h2 id="direct-title" class="h2">We're here when<br>you're ready.</h2>
          <p>Prefer to connect another way? Reach out directly, and we'll help you take the next step.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ct-direct__body">
          <dl class="ct-direct__list">
            <div class="ct-direct__row reveal">
              <dt>Give us a call</dt>
              <dd>
                <a class="ct-direct__value" href="tel:+18557398361">855.739.8361</a>
                <span>Published agency phone number</span>
              </dd>
              <a class="ct-direct__arrow" href="tel:+18557398361" aria-label="Call Get Lagos Now at 855.739.8361">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg>
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="ct-direct__row reveal">
              <dt>Based in</dt>
              <dd>
                <strong class="ct-direct__value">Portland, Oregon</strong>
                <span>Mailing address: PO Box 15164, Portland, OR 97293 (mailing address only, not a walk-in office)</span>
              </dd>
              <span class="ct-direct__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="ct-direct__row reveal">
              <dt>What to expect</dt>
              <dd>
                <strong class="ct-direct__value">Within 24 hours</strong>
                <span>Messages are answered within 24 hours during normal operating hours (per published website).</span>
              </dd>
              <span class="ct-direct__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
          </dl>

          <div class="ct-direct__socials reveal">
            <span class="ct-direct__socials-label">Connect</span>
            <ul class="socials socials--light" aria-label="Social media">
              <li><span class="social-placeholder" aria-label="LinkedIn (link to be confirmed)">in</span></li>
              <li><span class="social-placeholder" aria-label="Instagram (link to be confirmed)">ig</span></li>
              <li><span class="social-placeholder" aria-label="Facebook (link to be confirmed)">fb</span></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="ct-direct__socials-note">Official social profile URLs to be confirmed before launch.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 04 WHAT HAPPENS NEXT? ============ -->
    <section class="ct-process section" aria-labelledby="process-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-head section-head--split ct-process__head reveal">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Our process</p>
            <h2 id="process-title" class="h2">Simple from the<br>very first step.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="ct-process__intro">We've kept the first step straightforward. Tell us about your needs, and we'll begin exploring how we can help.</p>
        </header>

        <ol class="ct-process__list">
          <li class="ct-process__item reveal">
            <span class="ct-process__num">01</span>
            <h3 class="ct-process__title">Send Your Inquiry</h3>
            <p class="ct-process__desc">Share a little about your organization, your goals, and what you're hoping to achieve.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="ct-process__item reveal">
            <span class="ct-process__num">02</span>
            <h3 class="ct-process__title">Let's Connect</h3>
            <p class="ct-process__desc">We'll review your message and discuss your needs, priorities, and potential opportunities.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="ct-process__item reveal">
            <span class="ct-process__num">03</span>
            <h3 class="ct-process__title">Explore the Possibilities</h3>
            <p class="ct-process__desc">Together, we'll identify a direction and discuss the most appropriate next steps.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 05 FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS ============ -->
    <section class="ct-faq section" id="contact-faq" aria-labelledby="ct-faq-title">
      <div class="container ct-faq__grid">
        <div class="ct-faq__intro reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Before we begin</p>
          <h2 id="ct-faq-title" class="h2">A few things<br>you might want to know.</h2>
          <p>Straightforward answers to common questions before starting a project conversation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion reveal">
          <div class="acc-item is-open">
            <h3 class="acc-head">
              <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="ct-acc-1" id="ct-acc-btn-1">
                <span>01 — What types of projects can I contact you about?</span>
                <span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
            </h3>
            <div class="acc-panel" id="ct-acc-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="ct-acc-btn-1">
              <p>Get Lagos Now provides website design and development, digital accessibility, SEO and AI visibility services, branding, digital marketing, and strategic consulting.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <h3 class="acc-head">
              <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ct-acc-2" id="ct-acc-btn-2">
                <span>02 — Can you redesign our existing website?</span>
                <span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
            </h3>
            <div class="acc-panel" id="ct-acc-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="ct-acc-btn-2" hidden>
              <p>Yes. Website redesign is among the agency's services. Share your current website and what you'd like to improve so the team can understand your requirements.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <h3 class="acc-head">
              <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ct-acc-3" id="ct-acc-btn-3">
                <span>03 — Do you offer ongoing support?</span>
                <span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
            </h3>
            <div class="acc-panel" id="ct-acc-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="ct-acc-btn-3" hidden>
              <p>Get Lagos Now provides services including website optimization and digital marketing. Contact the team to discuss available ongoing support options.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="acc-item">
            <h3 class="acc-head">
              <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ct-acc-4" id="ct-acc-btn-4">
                <span>04 — How much will my project cost?</span>
                <span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
            </h3>
            <div class="acc-panel" id="ct-acc-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="ct-acc-btn-4" hidden>
              <p>Every project has different requirements. Share your goals and project scope to begin discussing the most appropriate approach and possible pricing.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 06 FINAL RED CTA (shared component) ============ -->
